stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ACTIVE
  ACTIVE --> WARNING: check-in due, email sent
  WARNING --> WARNING: reminder 1 and 2
  WARNING --> PENDING_APPROVAL: reminders ignored, trusted people asked
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> WAITING_PERIOD: k trusted people approve
  WAITING_PERIOD --> UNLOCKED: waiting period over, approvals still valid
  WAITING_PERIOD --> PENDING_APPROVAL: someone removed, too few approvals
  WARNING --> ACTIVE: owner is okay
  PENDING_APPROVAL --> ACTIVE: owner is okay
  WAITING_PERIOD --> ACTIVE: owner is okay
  UNLOCKED --> ACTIVE: owner returns and closes access
